WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.078
Month gives your larger goals a nearer focus.
Imagine choosing two

00:00:04.078 --> 00:00:07.906
walks to enjoy, a clear spare-room floor, and
a date for

00:00:07.906 --> 00:00:08.950
the family weekend.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.000
Finding two walks supports the walking rhythm
you want this quarter.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:18.962
Clearing the floor is a smaller goal within
making the spare

00:00:18.962 --> 00:00:19.800
room usable.

00:00:20.150 --> 00:00:24.050
Agreeing on a date moves the family weekend
closer.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:28.638
Now choose an activity toward a monthly goal.
Sort one box

00:00:28.638 --> 00:00:32.876
can go into this week, then onto today when
you choose

00:00:32.876 --> 00:00:37.115
a day. Clear the floor remains on the month
list, connected

00:00:37.115 --> 00:00:41.353
to the bigger home goal. Smaller actions
support it; finishing one

00:00:41.353 --> 00:00:44.050
does not automatically finish the whole goal.
